*.zwc
# Pre-d6e8a75 Antigen lock: a directory, or an empty file left by shells that spanned the
# update (they kept the old ANTIGEN_DOTFILES_LOCK). Unused now; safe to delete.
.antigen-cache.lock
# ~/.claude used to link here, so Claude Code's state (login, history, transcripts) lived in
# this directory. setup.sh moves it back to ~/.claude; until then, keep it out of git. This
# also covers project-local Claude settings for this repo.
/.claude/
# Karabiner-Elements writes these into ~/.config/karabiner, which links here.
/karabiner/automatic_backups/
